flowchart TD
    W[Waiting thread\nimplicit current = W] --> Q[queue_me\nq->task = current]
    W --> RQW[futex_wait_requeue_pi\nq.rt_waiter = &rt_waiter]
    RQW -. sleeps / hands off .-> Q
    C[Requeue caller\nimplicit current = C] --> RQ[futex_requeue]
    Q --> ST[stored this->task = W]
    RQ --> P[rt_mutex_start_proxy_lock\nexplicit task = W]
    ST --> P
    P --> B[task_blocks_on_rt_mutex\nwaiter->task = W]
    P --> E{ret non-zero?}
    E -- yes --> X[remove_waiter]
    X --> BAD[current->pi_blocked_on = NULL\ncurrent = C in cross-context call]
    B -. identity separation .-> M[waiter->task W != current C]
    M -. runtime observation missing .-> U[D1-R unknown]
    E -. source error provenance .-> D[deadlock/chain return path\nsource only]
    F[Fixed reference] --> GOOD[waiter_task = waiter->task\ncleanup waiter task]

    classDef source fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#4776a8,color:#102a43;
    classDef warning fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#b7791f,color:#5f370e;
    classDef unknown fill:#fde2e2,stroke:#c53030,color:#742a2a;
